# Block Drop — Terraform overlay

Platform layout/CI: `app-terraform`.

## Naming / state

- Pattern: `[environment]-block-drop-[purpose]-[resource-type]` (e.g. `stg-block-drop-site-bucket`).
- State bucket: `shared-block-drop-terraform-state-bucket`; keys `bootstrap/`, `envs/stg/`, `envs/prod/`, `cloudflare/`, `grafana/`.
- Plan role: `shared-block-drop-terraform-plan-role` + GitHub Environment `terraform` (`infra/terraform/docs/terraform-plan-ci.md`).
- AWS provider `default_tags`: `Project = "blockdrop"` (plus `Environment`) on bootstrap / stg / prod.

## Domains

| Env | Domain |
|-----|--------|
| stg | `blockdrop-stg.7oas7er.com` |
| prod | `blockdrop.7oas7er.com` |

## App-specific

- OIDC provider managed in **stg** only; prod looks it up.
- High-scores Lambda: `s3:GetObject`/`PutObject` only on `{bucket}/high-scores.json`; Node 22 package via `infra/lambda` (`npm ci --omit=dev`); zip includes `node_modules`.
- High-score buckets: `prevent_destroy` + versioning (noncurrent expire ~90d). Site bucket unversioned.
- **Origin-verify**: AWS `origin_verify_secret` must match platform `shared-edge` inject secrets; rotate via `infra/terraform/docs/origin-verify-secret-rotation.md`. Block Drop Cloudflare root is **DNS-only** (no zone rulesets here).
- Zone cache / redirects / `/api/scores` rate limit / SSL: platform `shared-edge` only.
- Access logs: `{env}-block-drop-access-logs-bucket` (CloudFront v2 + S3 site). Lambda log group finite retention; CF 5xx alarms in `us-east-1`.
